# Kleopatra — GPG key management. Same shape as org.keepassxc.KeePassXC: this
# handles the other kind of secret (signing/decryption keys, not passwords),
# and the same "network is a real feature, not a mistake" logic applies —
# keyserver lookup/publish needs NETWORK=allow, but that is a keyserver seeing
# every key you touch, not something to default on. Settings -> App
# permissions flips it for anyone who wants that trade.
NETWORK=deny
FILES=portal
CAMERA=deny
MIC=deny
USB=deny
SENSORS=deny
